;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; ROBINFNT.MAC -- font glyphs.
;
; Ported verbatim from the ZX original: 8x8 glyphs, 8 bytes each, one bit per
; pixel, most significant bit leftmost -- the same layout the shadow bitmap uses,
; so glyph bytes go straight into SHADOWPIX.
;
; Codes 040-377 (224. glyphs).  Codes below 040 are control codes for the printer
; and have no cell in the table, so the data starts at code 040 and FONTBASE is
; biased back by 040*8. to keep the "code * 8." indexing of the original.
;
; Codes 040-137 double as literal ASCII; higher codes are the custom icon and
; decoration glyphs used by the HUD and the message printer.
;
; ZX source: $AC33 + code*8, glyph data $AD33-$B432.
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FONT:
FONTBASE = FONT - <040*8.>	; so that glyph N sits at FONTBASE + N*8.

